              {
                "text": " was among the participating musicians. The production included four compositions by Carla and a tribute to the songwriter. Her official channel also preserves her interpretation of the bolero «Veinte años».",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Legacy",
                "type": "text",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "bold"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Her career connects Dominican romantic song with the stages of the New York diaspora. Her historical recordings and continued presence on digital platforms document different periods of her work as an interpreter.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          }
